# The platform folders are release payloads (4-7 GB each), published as
# GitHub release assets one folder per tag, never committed. The scripts,
# the pins, the notices and this file are the repo.
*-jp[0-9]/
host-prebuilts-out/
host-prebuilts-build/
# Per-run build logs from the box that built; the archive keeps its own
# PROVENANCE inside the platform folder.
BUILD_INFO_*.txt
.build.state.json
# The host (NUC) build output, pulled here under whatever name it was given.
focal/
host-*/
